=== Appearances in other series ===
The ''Ultimate Spider-Man'' incarnation of Spider-Man makes guest appearances in ''[[Avengers Assemble (TV series)|Avengers Assemble]]'', ''[[Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H.]]'', and the ''[[Phineas and Ferb]]'' episode "[[Phineas and Ferb: Mission Marvel]]".<ref>{{cite news |last= |first= |date=August 14, 2013 |title=Phineas and Ferb: Mission Marvel Interviews: Drake Bell, Alyson Stoner, and more [D23 Expo] |url=https://www.tvequals.com/2013/08/14/phineas-and-ferb-mission-marvel-interviews-drake-bell-alyson-stoner-and-more-d23-expo/ |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130819045504/https://www.tvequals.com/2013/08/14/phineas-and-ferb-mission-marvel-interviews-drake-bell-alyson-stoner-and-more-d23-expo/ |archive-date=August 19, 2013 |accessdate=June 17, 2022 |work=TV Equals |publisher=TV Equals.com}}</ref>

